<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: 7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita &nbsp;(Read 3337 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57" title="View the profile of Givins">Givins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 152<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/givins.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Illuminating mobs since 2001<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=5226347" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=5226347&amp;img=5" alt="5226347" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg989#msg989"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg989#msg989">7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> May 25, 2003, 01:42:56 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It turns out that this is perfectly legal to do, but in my opinion, this is very ugly play nonetheless. &nbsp;Here goes:<br /><br />Tonight, I gated into Iceclad to look for General Bragmur. &nbsp;Gen. Bragmur is the quest mob to start the final shawl. &nbsp;He's usually up, and tonight was the same. &nbsp;He was up in his appropriate spot. &nbsp;I call for guild help, and we port about 20 in the zone. &nbsp;While I was sitting in front of the quest mob, a Century of Flame character pops in front of me. &nbsp;Then 3 more pop. &nbsp;Four total now. &nbsp;I can't remember all four, but two of them were Katherin and Rakina. &nbsp;I get a bad feeling in my gut, and sure enough, Katherin starts the quest in front of my face. &nbsp;Rakina aggros General Bragmur, to keep him from starting his trek, and Century of Flame apparently begins to summon enough help to finish this quest. &nbsp;I didn't have my log on at the beginning, but I did turn it on in time to capture a bit of what happened, including my conversation with the 2 GM's that showed up. &nbsp;I also captured some of the comments I got from Badandy and Alenauth. &nbsp;They seemed to be pretty proud of how they acted, and in fact, Alenauth mocks me at the end, when they successfully complete Katherin's quest. &nbsp;<br /><br />[Sat May 24 21:47:36 2003] Logging to 'eqlog.txt' is now *ON*.<br />[Sat May 24 21:47:50 2003] You tell your party, 'someone prolly alerted Century for whatever reason'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:01 2003] Lyztyz tells you, 'its a turn in item to start it?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:08 2003] You told Lyztyz, 'yes'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:19 2003] You tell your raid, 'They started it, and plan to memblur him'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:24 2003] You tell your raid, 'They're calling raid forces right now.'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:28 2003] Qiara tells the raid, &nbsp;'they waiting for the forces yah'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:44 2003] Rakina says, 'i assure you wer are fine'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:50 2003] Lyztyz tells you, 'anyone was here at mob first?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:48:55 2003] You told Lyztyz, 'no, was here alone.'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:01 2003] Castamist tells the raid, &nbsp;'what the hell? who is bragmur bonking'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:04 2003] You told Lyztyz, 'someone alerted Century of Flame I think'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:07 2003] Khaarma tells the raid, &nbsp;'wasnt Givins here first?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:20 2003] Qiara tells the raid, &nbsp;'GM's on can we pettition? we are here and ready...'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:21 2003] You tell your raid, 'they got aggro and plan to memblur it and resume quest I am guessing.'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:31 2003] Qiara tells the raid, &nbsp;'yes he was'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:35 2003] Lyztyz tells you, 'you were here?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:38 2003] Qiara tells the raid, &nbsp;'they uninvised and turned it in'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:41 2003] Lyztyz tells you, 'you were here before them?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:43 2003] You told Lyztyz, 'hehe, yes, been here this whole time'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:45 2003] You told Lyztyz, 'way before'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:47 2003] Elfuego says, 'Hail, Badandy'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:54 2003] You told Lyztyz, 'no sign of Century of Flame until a couple of min ago'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:57 2003] Qwanran tells the raid, &nbsp;'if they memblur than we can start right'<br />[Sat May 24 21:49:59 2003] Lyztyz says, 'very rude of you not to notice my guild meber here'<br />[Sat May 24 21:50:07 2003] Rakina says, 'i was here first'<br />[Sat May 24 21:50:08 2003] Tgressus tells the raid, &nbsp;'evac out '<br />[Sat May 24 21:50:10 2003] You tell your raid, 'No Qwan, I didn't do turn in.'<br />[Sat May 24 21:50:22 2003] Rakina says, 'bye'<br />[Sat May 24 21:50:25 2003] Rakina says, 'have a great day'<br />[Sat May 24 21:50:33 2003] Castamist says, 'Century of Flame.. noted'<br />[Sat May 24 21:50:42 2003] Madx says, 'rut roh were noted'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:08 2003] You petition, 'We have a dispute here in Iceclad over 8th shawl. &nbsp;Need immediate assistance.'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:17 2003] Madx says, 'let me tell ya im shakeing in my boots........'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:31 2003] Savidlin says, 'whys the general atacking peps?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:37 2003] Tgressus says, 'cock block'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:38 2003] Qiara tells the guild, 'time to go'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:38 2003] Wyztyz tells the raid, &nbsp;'Givins you were here first?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:45 2003] You tell your raid, 'yes!'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:48 2003] Tgressus tells the raid, &nbsp;'everyopne port out'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:54 2003] Tgressus tells the raid, &nbsp;'lets leave this situation'<br />[Sat May 24 21:51:56 2003] You tell your raid, 'No sign of Century of Flame in zone when I was here.'<br />[Sat May 24 21:52:00 2003] Trypha tells the raid, &nbsp;'SoE doesn't give a chit who here first'<br />[Sat May 24 21:52:03 2003] Rakina says, 'im sorry you guys didnt get your turn in first have a good day'<br /><br />[Sat May 24 21:55:18 2003] Keldaria tells you, 'Greetings Guide Keldaria Responding to your petition how can i assist you today?'<br />[Sat May 24 21:55:57 2003] You told Keldaria, 'okay, I was in IC and Gen. Bragmur was up. &nbsp;Got my guild together here in IC and prepared to do turn in. &nbsp;Another guild, Century of Flame ran up and started quest just to block us. &nbsp;They are now summoning forces.'<br />[Sat May 24 21:56:02 2003] You told Keldaria, 'what can we do?'<br />[[Sat May 24 21:56:32 2003] Keldaria tells you, 'nothing really since they started the quest first'<br />[Sat May 24 21:59:55 2003] Keldaria tells you, 'i'm sorry '<br />[Sat May 24 22:00:17 2003] You say to your guild, 'This is the way SoE lets the game be played. &nbsp;Nothing we can do about it.'<br />[Sat May 24 22:00:45 2003] Madx says, 'ah gm'<br />[Sat May 24 22:00:47 2003] Madx says, 'run'<br />[Sat May 24 22:00:58 2003] Madx says, 'it was badandy i swear'<br />[Sat May 24 22:01:03 2003] Rakina says, 'lol'<br />[Sat May 24 22:01:18 2003] Madx says, 'bring any cookies and milk keldaria? &gt;&lt;'<br />[Sat May 24 22:05:07 2003] Rakina says, 'madx you getting us milk and cookie delivery?'<br />[Sat May 24 22:05:20 2003] Yippet says, 'Hiya folks, I understand there is a dispute as to who has the rights to this encounter'<br />[Sat May 24 22:05:57 2003] Yippet says, 'I only have one question, which guild triggered the event?'<br />[Sat May 24 22:06:18 2003] Klartu tells the guild, 'what guild took him?'<br />[Sat May 24 22:06:18 2003] Kurdran says, 'CoF'<br />[Sat May 24 22:06:30 2003] Hyren tells the guild, 'Century of Flame'<br />[Sat May 24 22:07:04 2003] Yippet says, 'Ok, well the group who triggered it has uncontested rights to it'<br />[Sat May 24 22:07:27 2003] Yippet says, 'Triggered encounters belong to those who actually triggered it.'<br />[Sat May 24 22:10:01 2003] Yippet says, 'There are specific rules reguarding triggered spawns. I have to abide by as well as enforce them'<br />[Sat May 24 22:10:03 2003] You say, 'You guys just taught me that the best way to do things is to jump in and start quests, no matter how many people are in zone to take out X mob.'<br />[Sat May 24 22:10:38 2003] You say, 'NP, good lesson guys.'<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:02 2003] Keldaria says, 'we are sorry for your misfortune but we cannot stop the already activated quest and reset it'<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:30 2003] You say, 'Thanks for responding at least.'<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:35 2003] Players on EverQuest:<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:35 2003] ---------------------------<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:35 2003] * GM * [54 Cavalier] Yippet (Erudite) &lt;High Order of Rodcet Nife&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:35 2003] * GM * [50 Necromancer] Keldaria (Dark Elf) &lt;High Order of Rodcet Nife&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:35 2003] There are 2 players in Iceclad Ocean.<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:38 2003] Keldaria says, 'here'<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:44 2003] Keldaria says, 'consolation prize'<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:51 2003] Keldaria has offered you a Valtron's Finest Brew.<br />[Sat May 24 22:11:56 2003] Keldaria has offered you a Milk.<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:02 2003] Keldaria has offered you a Magical Cookie.<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:03 2003] Yippet tells you, 'Good luck next time, hopefully you'll be able to trigger it in advance'<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:06 2003] Keldaria has offered you a Gnome Sandwich.<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:16 2003] Givins saved.<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:31 2003] Keldaria beams a smile at Givins.<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:34 2003] You told Yippet, 'Thanks for responding.'<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:47 2003] Keldaria says, 'sorry &nbsp;about this maybe you can do it later <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />'<br />[Sat May 24 22:12:48 2003] You say, 'Lol. &nbsp;Thanks for coming out. &nbsp;Bad rule tho.'<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:05 2003] Keldaria bows before Givins.<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:09 2003] You bow before Keldaria.<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:10 2003] Keldaria snaps her fingers.<br /><br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] Players on EverQuest:<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] ---------------------------<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] [65 Archon] Badandy (Dark Elf) &lt;Century of Flame&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] [60 Warlord] Anafiel (Ogre) &lt;Century of Flame&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] [59 Conjurer] Elfuego (High Elf) &lt;Century of Flame&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] [ANONYMOUS] Madx &nbsp;&lt;Century of Flame&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] [55 Revenant] Rakina (Iksar) &lt;Century of Flame&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] [61 Phantasmist] Katherin (Dark Elf) &lt;Century of Flame&gt;<br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] [ANONYMOUS] Zepp <br />[Sat May 24 22:13:26 2003] There are 7 players in Iceclad Ocean.<br /><br />[Sat May 24 22:26:39 2003] Badandy tells you, 'i have no problem reporting you..plz leave the area..as per GM'<br />[Sat May 24 22:28:02 2003] You told Badandy, 'No GM has told me to leave. &nbsp;I'm watching, I don't think there is anything wrong with that. &nbsp;I'm surprised you'd have a problem after what you guys just did.\'<br />[Sat May 24 22:28:24 2003] Badandy tells you, 'we will see..i am in direct contact'<br />[Sat May 24 22:28:29 2003] You told Badandy, 'ok'<br /><br />(note: &nbsp;I never heard anything from the GM's ever again)<br /><br />[Sat May 24 23:01:00 2003] Alenauth taps Givins on the shoulder.<br />[Sat May 24 23:01:16 2003] Alenauth says, 'she is beautiful isnt she? &nbsp;sometimes i just go hypnotic staring at her too'<br /><br />[Sat May 24 22:51:04 2003] Alenauth is an officer of Arcana Amicitia.<br />[Sat May 24 22:53:43 2003] Badandy is an officer of Century of Flame.<br /><br /><br />Well...at least I got some cookies and milk out of it. &nbsp;And maybe some will get a laugh out of this story!<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Klozz 69th level Warrior, Givins, 65th level Wizard of Inner Loop
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg990"></a>
