								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg996#msg996">Re:7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> May 27, 2003, 09:41:30 am &#187;</span></td>
