								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Crap that sucks! SoE has policies that are &quot;supposed&quot; to enforce fair game play, but in that case they should allow some form of intervention on the behalf of the GM. Sorry to tie thier hands and allow complete assholes like this off the hook is so insane!<br /><br />This is one of the few instances I will be forwarding this to my guild to avoid all contact with Century of Flame members. If thier officers are that bad, then thier guild must be as well. Same with Arcana Amicitia.<br /><br />I will be advising our guild members that if they group with these people they do so at thier own risk, and if a problem arises, they can't say they were not warned.
						</td>
