	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1001"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=184" title="View the profile of Katherin">Katherin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=184"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1001#msg1001"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1001#msg1001">Re:7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> May 27, 2003, 02:31:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							So quick to judge after one side is heard. I don't do politics nor do I care for them<br /><br />Rakina got there and no one else was there. Rest of us arrived I started quest we formed up groups and finished the quest. I don't have any nice logs to post that I've taken things out that might make me look bad. Infact the only complaint I heard while there was the fact how we just &quot;waisted&quot; the quest and yalls time how we were going to fail and other comments on how we were going to fail. We said we were fine with our two groups and Ya'll laughed, then we did it with our 2 groups.<br /><br />Petitioned was mentioned so we held the general there until a GM could show up to solve it. After the GM showed up and made their decision we let the General go and finished the quest with no problem. It would have been stupid to be half way in the route when a GM to show up and try to hold the general there with adds from wanders while they decided on what was right.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
