								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=265105278" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=265105278&amp;img=5" alt="265105278" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/Wyztyz" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Wyztyz"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Wyztyz&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Wyztyz&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=167"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.dragonsfist.org" title="Dragons Fist" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:wyztyz@aol.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1007#msg1007"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1007#msg1007">Re:7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> May 27, 2003, 06:19:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Dragons Fist and its members are honorable, ethical and respectful people. &nbsp;It is customary that many of us in DF keep logs and do not have any logs referring to what you are accusing. &nbsp;We have survived on the Rodcet Nife server due to the respect &nbsp;and consideration we share with many players and guilds for &quot;years.&quot; <br /><br />It was not worth our time to argue over a mob that spawns every four hours even though it was &quot;ninja&quot; engaged. &nbsp;DF respecting SoE rules of mob engagement opted to port out and keep our guild productive that day.<br /><br />Blacklisting an entire guild, <b>Century of Flame</b> may be a bit harsh since this is the first negative encounter, I've come across with <b>Century of Flame</b>. &nbsp;In fact, is <b>CoF </b> a new guild? &nbsp;I never heard of them until the above incident. &nbsp;The <b>CoF</b> guild itself , we should not discredit because of a mere few rude individuals. &nbsp;There maybe some good people in that guild. &nbsp;However, I think the guild leader and the officers of <b>CoF </b> should be alerted to the few <b>&quot;bad apples&quot;</b> &nbsp;representing their guild tag. &nbsp;<br /><br />Take note: &nbsp;In defense of Givins, he &nbsp;is one of the most respectful, caring and unselfish players on this server. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Wyztyz Wyckedwytz<br />Wizardess of the Solusek Ro and the 66th Season<br />Broodmother and Guild Leader to Dragons Fist on Rodcet Nife<br />RL &gt; EQ.  Keep it in perspective!
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1008"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=184" title="View the profile of Katherin">Katherin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=184"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1008#msg1008"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1008#msg1008">Re:7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> May 27, 2003, 06:54:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I did not mean to say that Givin or anyone in DF wasnt honorable, &nbsp;That a guild leader of a guild would say that and beleive that goes with out question.<br /><br />What I was refering to was the logs was were pieces was not in it, Givin may have just shortened it and cut out parts that didnt partain to this matter so that it would fit and not be a lengthy read and in doing so some of the other chat might have been cut out. Or some of it could have been says when Givins wasnt near the person who said it.<br /><br />Like you said, this isnt one entire guild, but a few individuals. Some of CoF might have acted less than friendly concerning this because in their eyes they saw someone trying to steal something from a friend. The same as you see it towards your friend. I could get numberous people to come here and post their thoughts and beliefs of me and they would be high, What friend wouldnt come to defend their friend? Just as Im sure Givin could have you're entire guild to come here to speak highly of him. We could both get people not in our guilds to come and speak for us, but in the end it wouldnt solve anything. It would turn into a contest who could get the most people to come to speak for them that others know so they would believe them.<br /><br />I do not know the entire truth of this no more than Givin or even the GM's do. I could not hear what everyone said in says, tells to others, raid says and all the other channels.<br /><br />Like you said it's a 4 hour mob, if I would have known it was this big of a problem and going to be hurt feelings over doing a quest I would have just walked away. It is alot easier for me to gather 2 groups of my friends for this and not nearly as hard as gathering a raid force to do the quest.<br /><br />If you wish I will see if I or anyone else have logs of the comments I was refering to and send them to you since you are the guildleader of those who said it.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1009"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57" title="View the profile of Givins">Givins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 152<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/givins.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Illuminating mobs since 2001<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=5226347" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=5226347&amp;img=5" alt="5226347" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1009#msg1009"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1009#msg1009">Re:7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> May 28, 2003, 05:21:48 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Katherin,<br /><br />I just don't understand why you guys had to look like total ass holes just to start the quest ahead of me. &nbsp;Was it that big of a deal? &nbsp;You guys acted like the General was the rarest spawn in all EQ. &nbsp;It reminded me of the Ancient Cyclops in SouthRo the way you guys behaved. &nbsp;I sure would have liked to have had an explanation for your behavior. &nbsp;And you guys definitely weren't sorry at the time, and your attitudes were, in fact, &nbsp;belligerent, bordering on hateful. &nbsp;It was very plain to see that you guys meant to cock block the quest so that you could summon more force. &nbsp;Trying to say that you guys didn't see anyone else in the zone is an outright lie, and I challenge you to produce any proof that your guild was there first. &nbsp;<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> &nbsp;Like you said it's a 4 hour mob, if I would have known it was this big of a problem and going to be hurt feelings over doing a quest I would have just walked away. It is alot easier for me to gather 2 groups of my friends for this and not nearly as hard as gathering a raid force to do the quest. &nbsp;</div><br />This part insults my intelligence. &nbsp;You saw a pretty big raid force there. &nbsp;So then why did you do it, Katherin? &nbsp;<br /><br />In any case, thanks for the support and opinions. &nbsp;It makes me feel better to know that most agree that this sort of behavior is abysmal. &nbsp;<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 28, 2003, 05:27:01 am by Givins</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Klozz 69th level Warrior, Givins, 65th level Wizard of Inner Loop
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
