	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1017"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=184" title="View the profile of Katherin">Katherin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=184"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1017#msg1017"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1017#msg1017">Re:7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> May 28, 2003, 01:26:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yes I defend my Guildmates the same as Wyztyz defends hers. I also defend my actions and no one elses. I believe they are able to speak for themselves. Why they havent posted here may well be they dont know about it. &nbsp;These forums are still new and I havent had time to log on and tell them about the post. I logged in last night for all of 5 mins and didnt see Badandy or anyone to speak to right off.<br /><br />You ask for proof to prove we were there first? There is none. There is nothing that we can produce to show it no more than you can and you know that. Rakina said there was no one there. When she arrived, I say that is my proof the same as you say you were there and no one was there as your proof.<br /><br />You want to know why I turned it in? Do not try to make yourself seem high here. If your force was all in place you would have turned it in to begin your quest regardless of who was there or whether it was in question if you were there first. <br /><br />I did NOT say we did not see anyone else in the zone. Saying something like that is like me saying <br /><br />&quot;You saying I am not a dark elf is a LIE&quot;<br /><br />No where was it said you werent in the zone and do not try to say I said that. Infact if you look at your logs you will see I said not ONE thing disrespectful or beligerant or anythign else you claim. From the START to the END and afterwards when we crossed paths with another of DF in PoD.<br /><br /><br />Kinladar, just to let ya know its Katherin, not to be a smartass, but my actions are mine and I don't want others to be blamed for somethign I was apart of. I believe there is a Kathrine, and I know there is another named Katherine or similar that is a cleric and she has her own rep.<br /><br /><br /><br /><i>My actions are mine and no one else. My friends know who I am and how I am.. People may take your name, your titles, your lands, and even your wealth, but they can never take your friends from you.</i>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1023"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=185" title="View the profile of Badandy">Badandy</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=185"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1023#msg1023"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=237.msg1023#msg1023">Re:7 from Century of Flame, 1 from Arcana Armicita</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> May 28, 2003, 11:17:01 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							i too do not keep logs, as i found that verant inhales vigerously to do anything needed of them, and i am highly surprised they even showed up to defend CoF on this issue. but neither here nor there.. you wanted to know my take.. here it is<br /> &nbsp; i showed up in zone, and went to the perspective spot where the general spawns. I mentioned after a few who was givins.. no one had a clue.. Rakina said she was 1st here..such as givins claims..it does not take 50 peeps to do quest..just a few that have an incling on what is to happen..and can follow orders. i saw all these peeps show up and told katherine that if we indeed were here 1st..to do turn in.. and we get under way. she turns in .. and THE OTHER guild decided to Ks.. i ask that rakina draw aggroe..and let GM settle this.. which is what happened. they have records of who what where and why. we took much ridicule from a few anal retensive individuals which includes givins .. how convinent these things were left out of log.. and at the conclusion GM even showed up and ask kat if all was well as they had a problem with Givins actions at staring her down.<br /> &nbsp;this is what happened! blacklist.. i am not a 12 year old tring to play badazz, I am a sucessful businessman and i have nothing to prove or disprove. I have played this game almost 5 years and if i were this incredibly bad individual; my name would have shown up way b4 now. Now i wish to stop this &quot;my dad can beat up your dad &quot; bull<br /> &nbsp;immediately after the quest i also rezzed at no charge.. one of your guildies in PoD. I do not charge for rezzes..but he did make an offer. any other questions..hit me up in game and feel free to ask.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
